WEBVTT

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:30.430
two disastrous world wars,

00:14:30.463 --> 00:14:31.597
the Holocaust,

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:32.863
nuclear warfare,

00:14:32.897 --> 00:14:34.597
species extinctions,

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:36.230
environmental degradation,

00:14:36.263 --> 00:14:37.430
factory farming

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.497
and, of course, global warming.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:42.963
The evidence is there
if you want to see it.

00:14:42.963 --> 00:14:47.163
Our model of reality has failed
catastrophically in practice.

00:14:48.763 --> 00:14:49.897
Third:

00:14:51.663 --> 00:14:55.597
other models and other
real worlds are possible.

00:14:56.363 --> 00:14:59.997
Other worlds are being lived
right now, as we speak,